@startuml
title D3 Diagnostic Flow — Entry and Stage-Adaptive Flow (Design-Only)
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8

' D3 FROZEN architecture; parameters PROPOSED / PENDING VALIDATION.
' assessmentType and deliveryMode are independent labels on every assessment.

start
:Learner selects target language;
note right
  assessmentType: DIAGNOSTIC / EXIT / RE_EVALUATION
  deliveryMode: PLACEMENT / JUMP / STANDARD
  (independent axes; no merged enum)
end note

if (Entry path?) then (Diagnostic evidence)
  :START assessment\n[assessmentType=DIAGNOSTIC]\n[deliveryMode=PLACEMENT or STANDARD];
  :ROUTING stage\n(mid-band routing items);
  note right
    Scale: ~25-30 items, <=15 min
    PROPOSED / PENDING VALIDATION
    No exact count / distribution chosen
  end note
  :TARGETED stage\n(branch to targeted band;\n4 dims: Vocab/Grammar/Reading/Listening);
  note right
    Branching + stopping policy:
    CONFIGURABLE / PENDING VALIDATION
    Item metadata: itemId + conceptId
    + dimension + band + versions
  end note
  :COMPLETE → emit AssessmentResult\n(responses + skillOutputs + stageData);
  :Update SkillProfile\n(4 dims + provenance +\nanchor PENDING);
  :Record verifiedProficiency +\ncurriculumStartingPoint;
else (Self-report / skip)
  :Record selfReportedLevel (UNVERIFIED)\nno SkillProfile write;
  :Assign provisional curriculumStartingPoint\n(default entry);
endif

:Enter learning at curriculumStartingPoint;
stop
@enduml
